## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Probe SV (first)
## Notes: SavedVariables cold-start companion to ForeverProbe, WITH LoadSavedVariablesFirst. Reported by /fprobe cold.
## LoadSavedVariablesFirst: 1
## X-SVVariant: First
## SavedVariables: ForeverProbeSV_FirstDB, ForeverProbeSV_FirstClobber, ForeverProbeSV_FirstOrInit
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverProbeSV_FirstChar, ForeverProbeSV_FirstCharClobber, ForeverProbeSV_FirstCharOrInit

# Directives must stay contiguous: a blank line between two ## lines ends the
# header and the client ignores everything after it.
#
# The directive line above is the ONLY header difference from
# ForeverProbeSV_Late, and it is copied from Blizzard's own Forever damage meter
# (research/watch-findings.md W.30). No dependency on ForeverProbe, on purpose:
# a dependency would change load order, which is the thing being measured.
#
# Core.lua is byte-identical in both variants; Init.lua differs only in names.
Core.lua
Init.lua
